+# TLS certificate verification in development builds
+
+The project's current recorded decision is "https everywhere, no exceptions", stated by the project owner. Development builds are not carved out of it, so no exception to TLS, and therefore none to certificate verification, is recorded for them. No separate, more specific setting for certificate verification in development builds is recorded beyond this general decision.
